WEBVTT

NOTE
Illustrated menu-path guide. Not an actual screen recording.

1
00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:06.375
Use your own Instagram export to review familiar handles. Menu names may vary.

2
00:00:06.375 --> 00:00:10.583
Open Instagram settings and look for Accounts Center.

3
00:00:10.583 --> 00:00:16.042
Look for Your information and permissions, then export or download your information.

4
00:00:16.042 --> 00:00:23.917
Choose your Instagram profile and your device. Select followers and following, and JSON if offered.

5
00:00:23.917 --> 00:00:30.958
Download when notified. If the archive is too large, extract the focused relationship lists.

6
00:00:30.958 --> 00:00:38.708
Import supported lists in the Genie. A follower is not automatically a warm contact; review who you recognize.
